{"seq":6,"slug":"ml-finance","title":"机器学习与金融应用","stage":"DONE","category":"quantitative-finance","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/ml-finance","rating":{"composite":4.1,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.33,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"机器学习与金融应用\">机器学习与金融应用</h1><p>机器学习（Machine Learning）正在深刻重塑金融行业的各个环节——从风险评估、资产定价到投资组合优化、交易策略生成，ML 模型已成为量化金融的核心引擎。与传统计量经济学方法相比，机器学习能够处理高维非线性特征交互、自适应学习市场结构变化，并在海量非结构化数据（新闻、社交媒体、卫星影像）中提取 alpha 信号。</p>\n<p>本 Hub 系统梳理机器学习在金融领域的理论基础与工程实践。<strong>金融 ML 基础</strong>部分涵盖监督学习、时间序列建模和特征工程三大支柱，建立从原始数据到可交易信号的完整管线认知。<strong>深度学习</strong>部分聚焦 LSTM/Transformer 时序预测、图神经网络关系建模，以及生成模型在数据增强与场景模拟中的前沿应用。<strong>金融 NLP</strong> 部分探讨情绪分析、新闻事件提取和大语言模型（LLM）在研报生成、风险合规中的落地实践。<strong>ML 实践挑战</strong>部分直面金融建模中最棘手的问题：低信噪比下的过拟合、监管对可解释性的强制要求，以及 MLOps 在交易模型全生命周期管理中的工程范式。</p>\n<p>内容定位于具备基础统计与编程能力的读者，强调「金融场景特殊性 × ML 方法适配」的交叉思维，而非泛泛的算法教程。每篇文档均包含数学推导、Python 代码示例、架构图与最新研究引用（截至 2025-2026 年），力求在理论深度与工程实操之间取得平衡。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ml-foundations","title":"金融 ML 基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/ml-finance/ml-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"supervised-learning-finance","title":"监督学习在金融中的应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/ml-finance/ml-foundations/supervised-learning-finance"},{"seq":2,"slug":"time-series-ml","title":"时间序列机器学习方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/ml-finance/ml-foundations/time-series-ml"},{"seq":3,"slug":"feature-engineering","title":"金融特征工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/ml-finance/ml-foundations/feature-engineering"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"deep-learning","title":"深度学习","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/ml-finance/deep-learning","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"lstm-transformer-finance","title":"LSTM 与 Transformer 金融预测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/ml-finance/deep-learning/lstm-transformer-finance"},{"seq":2,"slug":"graph-neural-networks","title":"图神经网络与金融关系建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/ml-finance/deep-learning/graph-neural-networks"},{"seq":3,"slug":"generative-models","title":"生成模型与金融数据合成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/ml-finance/deep-learning/generative-models"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"nlp-finance","title":"金融 NLP","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/ml-finance/nlp-finance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sentiment-analysis","title":"市场情绪分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/ml-finance/nlp-finance/sentiment-analysis"},{"seq":2,"slug":"news-event-extraction","title":"新闻事件提取与因果推断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/ml-finance/nlp-finance/news-event-extraction"},{"seq":3,"slug":"llm-finance","title":"大语言模型在金融中的应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/ml-finance/nlp-finance/llm-finance"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"ml-practice","title":"ML 实践挑战","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/ml-finance/ml-practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"overfitting-finance","title":"金融中的过拟合与正则化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/ml-finance/ml-practice/overfitting-finance"},{"seq":2,"slug":"interpretability","title":"模型可解释性与监管要求","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/ml-finance/ml-practice/interpretability"},{"seq":3,"slug":"mlops-trading","title":"MLOps 与交易模型生命周期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/ml-finance/ml-practice/mlops-trading"}]}]}